# Medium-vuln remediation — PR plan

**Repo:** `normainofficial/normain` (Yarn Berry monorepo, 59 workspaces) · **Branch scanned by Vanta:** `main`
**Vanta test:** Medium vulnerabilities identified in packages are addressed (GitHub Repo) — 43 open alerts, 16 packages.
**Date:** 2026-06-08

## Root cause
`main`'s **`yarn.lock` is stale**. Most declared `package.json` ranges already permit the patched version — the lockfile just pins older. **No open Dependabot PRs exist**, so we create the bumps ourselves. A minority are genuinely transitive (exact-pinned by a parent) and need a `resolutions` override or parent bump. One (`uuid`) is already risk-accepted.

